  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.29 “Friable asbestos material” means “friable asbestos material” as defined in RSA 141-E:2, VI, as reprinted in Appendix C. The term includes “friable ACM.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
